# Sound ids: tabb12wave = 11, tabb41wave = 27 (read from sounds.jsonl info after the tag mapping; not resolved independently from the DAT).
# R-1: the 12-step ladder [25k, 50k, 75k, 150k, 175k, 200k, 275k, 300k, 325k, 425k, 450k, 475k]
# indexed 0/3/6/9 by the lit count of the combo light group (+1/+2 by the wind group, which only gets lit in mode 2). Mode 3 (not 2, not 5):
# no wind light flashes, so five Island hits 3 s apart (the 2.0 s flashes have ended) score 25k, 150k, 275k, 425k, 425k. Expected values
# come from the ladder row, not from a run. Text 3004 is the Island text (listing 4172).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
150 poke info_text_box message_field 3
199 expect n_score == 0
200 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
200 expect sound 11
201 expect n_score == 25000
200 expect text info_text_box display id 3004
500 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
501 expect n_score == 175000
800 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
801 expect n_score == 450000
1100 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
1101 expect n_score == 875000
1400 event a_ramp8 ControlBallToLayer2
1401 expect n_score == 1300000
1450 quit
